<delurk>

The alternative to a given finite length is not automatically
infinite. If the length is given as N, then a N+1 sentence is outside
this model.

Of course, for practical matters we just make N really big. Like with
the computers where the model says they need infinite tape, which
obviously can't exist in a finite universe.

